    "flujo": [
      {
        "en": "The request arrives; the router classifies the type of care.",
        "es": "Llega la solicitud; el enrutador clasifica el tipo de atención."
      },
      {
        "en": "If it is an emergency or an exempt service, it is approved without a coverage check (law and benefit plan).",
        "es": "Si es urgencia o un servicio exento, se autoriza sin verificar cobertura (ley y plan de beneficios)."
      },
      {
        "en": "The extractor turns the text into fields with a stated confidence.",
        "es": "El extractor convierte el texto en campos con una confianza declarada."
      },
      {
        "en": "If required fields are missing, a clarification is requested (max 2 cycles).",
        "es": "Si faltan campos obligatorios, se pide aclaración (máximo 2 ciclos)."
      },
      {
        "en": "If the model does not respond while extracting or clarifying, the case goes to a person with whatever there is; it is never made up.",
        "es": "Si el modelo no responde al extraer o al aclarar, el caso pasa a una persona con lo que haya; jamás se inventa."
      },
      {
        "en": "The coverage checker applies rules: exempt services, exclusions with cause, high cost, order/text contradiction.",
        "es": "El verificador de cobertura aplica reglas: exentos, exclusiones con causal, alto costo, contradicción orden/texto."
      },
      {
        "en": "Three-way decision: approve, deny (always with a human) or escalate to the auditor.",
        "es": "Decisión de tres caminos: aprobar, negar (siempre con humano) o escalar al auditor."
      },
      {
        "en": "The writer drafts the response; the deterministic guard filters it; if adverse, the adverse-decision document is issued.",
        "es": "El redactor produce la respuesta; la guardia determinista la filtra; si es adversa, sale el documento de decisión adversa."
      }
    ],
